h, over all things, competent.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"33:28","t":"O Prophet, say to your wives, \"If you should desire the worldly life and its adornment, then come, I will provide for you and give you a gracious release.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"33:29","t":"But if you should desire Allāh and His Messenger and the home of the Hereafter - then indeed, Allāh has prepared for the doers of good among you a great reward.\"","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"33:30","t":"O wives of the Prophet, whoever of you should commit a clear immorality - for her the punishment would be doubled two fold, and ever is that, for Allāh, easy.","j":21,"h":42,"s":33,"a":30,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":42,"surahs":[33],"sajdah":false}